## 🚦 Kitchen Service State

**Stage:** `menu-locked`

| Stage | Meaning | Next Culinary Command |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `menu-locked` | Menu & Taste System ready, *mise en place* not run yet | Run **`/prep`** (`docs/dishes/00-prep/courses.md`) |
| `prepped` | Base app & 0-token Mechanical Architecture Linter active | Run **`/taste <01-dish-slug>`** to sample the first Tasting Spoon |
| `service` | Active dish crafting in progress | **`/taste`** → **`/cook`** (3 Courses) → **`/plate`** (4-Star Audit) |

